# Plans live under `.cursor/plans`

When writing, updating, or saving a plan, design doc, or implementation plan:

- Put it in `.cursor/plans/` (create the folder if needed)
- Use a kebab-case markdown filename, e.g. `.cursor/plans/rebuild-installers.md`
- Do **not** write plans to repo-root `plans/`, `docs/plans/`, or chat-only files meant to persist

If an older plan still lives under `plans/`, move it into `.cursor/plans/` when you next edit it.
